# doc-translator-action: files/globs excluded from translation, one pattern per line.
# A bare filename (no "/") matches at any depth, like .gitignore.

CHANGELOG.md
DRAFT_*.md

# This repo's own dogfooding output (docs/{lang}/...) - belt-and-suspenders alongside the
# provenance-header check in TranslationOrchestrator, which is what actually protects any
# output-path-template shape, including ones that don't use a dedicated language folder.
docs/tr/**
docs/de/**
